<!--
=====================================================================
S91 · HANAMACHI — A JAPANESE CANAL TOWN
18 s · 1280x720 · 24 fps · procedural town with a Character1 GLB performance
=====================================================================

COMPOSITION
  A camera drift over a canal town on a clear day leads into Character1
  performing with a native procedural sword. The town is built from
  PrimitiveAsset geometry, CompoundAsset assemblies and VegetationAsset plants.

  Listed subjects
    torii gate · shinto shrine · machiya wooden houses · tiled roofs ·
    shopping street · stone steps · sakura trees · mountain scenery ·
    canal with stone banks · small bridge · paper lanterns · vending
    machines · utility poles with wires · distant Mount Fuji

  Living details
    drifting clouds · falling sakura petals · swaying paper lanterns ·
    breathing water ripples · chimney smoke · wind-animated vegetation

  Light: warm sun key with shadows, cool sky fill, ambient occlusion,
  contact shadows, exponential haze and ACES grading, finished with a
  restrained bloom and deterministic grain.
=====================================================================
-->
